 "editTitle": "删除分录操作接口",
 "title": "删除分录操作接口",
 "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 20px\"><strong>1 接口介绍</strong></p><p>删除分录操作服务是指通过在请求体中按规范输入json格式的参数，调用服务给指定的单据或基础资料执行删除分录的保存操作。</p><p></p><p style=\"font-size: 20px\"><strong>2 注意事项</strong></p><p>1）接口仅支持单条数据删除分录，暂时不支持子分录删除；</p><p>2）请求体中的参数<strong>”entryName”</strong>是分录标识，不同单据的分录及同一单据的不同分录，标识可能不同，需要特别注意。</p><p>3）若不确定需要删除的分录的id，可以先通过查询服务API，查到对应单据的分录内码。</p><p></p><p style=\"font-size: 20px\"><strong>3 接口示例</strong></p><p style=\"font-size: 18px\"><strong>采购订单删除分录</strong></p><table style=\"width: 655px\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 655px\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"655\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p><strong>URL：</strong>{{host}}/kapi/sys/pm_purorderbill/deleteentryrows</p><p></p><p><strong>请求方式：</strong>POST</p><p></p><p><strong>请求Header参数：</strong></p><p>Content-Type=application/json</p><p>accessToken: xxxxxxxxxxxxx</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><table style=\"width: 655px\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 655px\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"655\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p><strong>请求Body：</strong></p><p>{</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;\"entryName\": \"billentry\",</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;\"data\": {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"id\": 1239845336667717632,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"billentry\": [</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;{</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"id\": 1239852533338406913</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;},</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;{</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"id\": 1239852533338406915</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;}</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;]</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;}</p><p>}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><table style=\"width: 655px\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 655px\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"655\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p><strong>请求结果：</strong></p><p>{</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;\"data\": {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"success\": true,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"needSign\": false,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"needWfAssignPersons\": false,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"cancelWriteLog\": true,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"showMessage\": true,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"billCount\": 1,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"successPkIds\": [</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1239845336667717632</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;],</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"billNos\": {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"1239845336667717632\": \"CGDD-202109-152272\"</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;},</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"validateResult\": {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"validateErrors\": [],</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"success\": true,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"message\": \"\",</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"errorPkIds\": [],</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"errorDataIndexs\": []</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;},</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"allErrorOrValidateInfo\": [],</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"runSecond\": 0,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"allErrorInfo\": []</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;},</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;\"success\": true,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;\"errorCode\": \"success\",</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;\"message\": null</p><p>}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-size: 20px\"></p><p style=\"font-size: 20px\"><strong>4 返回参数说明</strong></p><table style=\"width: 600px\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 39px\"><col style=\"width: 74px\"><col style=\"width: 82px\"><col style=\"width: 405px\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"39\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p><strong>序号</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"74\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"82\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p><strong>解释</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p><strong>返回值实例</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"18\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>1</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"75\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>success</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"81\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>是否成功</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>true/false</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"18\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>2</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"75\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>errorCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"81\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>错误编码</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>success/false</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"18\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>3</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"75\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>message</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"81\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>提示信息</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p><span>成功时为null，失败时会返回错误信息</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"18\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>4</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"75\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>data</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"81\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>业务对象数据</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" data-background-color=\"\" style=\"background-color: \"><p>{\"successPkIds\":[1239845336667717632],\"billNos\":{\"1239845336667717632\": \"CGDD-202109-152272\" },...}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p>",
